<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61011" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύπριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of
				Cyprus, Cyprian</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.19
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθος</span> K., a kind of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμάραγδος</span> (found in Cyprus,
				<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				25
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Achae.
				5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				37.66
			</span></i>; K. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					77
				</span></i>
			; K. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραπέτασμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					611
				</span></i>
			; K. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάριχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Posidipp.
					17
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῦς</span> K., prov. of an
				<i>unclean feeder</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diogenian.
				3.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>, etc.; K. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλαμος,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόναξ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.85
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κυπρία</span></b> , ἡ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύπρις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				1.75
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύπρια</span></b> , τά, an Epic poem introductory to the <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.117
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1459b2
			</span></i>.</div>
